# M4: the About box from the Help menu, recent files after an open and a save, and the settings file the run leaves behind.
@copy plain.qld
f10 down enter                            # File > Open...
p l a i n period q l d enter
f10 right right right right right right right enter   # Help > About Quill...
enter
f10                                       # File menu with the recent file listed
esc
f10 down down down enter                  # File > Save As...
c o p y period q l d enter
f10 down down down down down down down enter             # File > Exit
